    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Chains + Super-Thermal Blade</h2><p>A heavy super-thermal greatblade paired with combat chains. The blade can separate into smaller split blades while the chains provide reach, control, and repositioning.</p><p><strong>Greatblade configuration:</strong> Greatblade Slash and Thermal Cut are available.</p><p><strong>Split Blades configuration:</strong> Split Blade Flurry is available.</p><p>Chain Snare, Chain Pull, and Chainbreaker Combo use manual control/movement where table geometry matters.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
